        "_note": "seam: scarf joint on the outer wall of walls without a sharp corner, not on leaning walls - seam test T26-000037 on a Kobra S1 (white PLA+, 10 Oct 2026): no seam ridge on a rounded box, a 25 degree cone as clean as without the scarf. One print on one machine: rows stay 'testing'. Ironing (used only when a print switches ironing on; no ironing_type here): flow 10 % / 30 mm/s / spacing 0.15 mm is the better of the two settings tried on a Kobra S1 with white PLA+ on 11 Oct 2026 - T26-000036 against T26-000040 (12 % / 0.1: more visible passes, drops pushed over the edge, a slightly smaller glossy area). The gloss is still not even with either."
