          "scarf_overhang_threshold": "40%",
          "ironing_flow": "12%",
          "ironing_speed": "30",
          "ironing_spacing": "0.1"
        },
        "_note": "top_surface_speed 120: at the profile's 200 mm/s (16.8 mm3/s, above the 16 mm3/s cap) the tops of the seam test T26-000038 (Max, 11 Oct 2026) came out with a ragged border and small gaps between an outer band and the middle; the quick test T26-000035 from the same turquoise spool at 120 had an even top. Seam values of the shipped profile on purpose: the scarf joint of the Kobra S1 block was not tested on the Max yet. Ironing 12 % / 30 mm/s / 0.1 mm as the Max's own production row holds them (version 3, earlier tuning); not printed again in October 2026"
      }
    },
